.TH "CSSFONTFACERULE.STYLE" "3JS" "April 17, 2026" "JavaScript" "JavaScript Reference Manual"
.SH NAME
CSSFontFaceRule.style \- CSSFontFaceRule: style property
.SH SYNOPSIS
The read\-only \f[B]\f[CB]style\f[B]\f[R] property of the
\f[CR]CSSFontFaceRule\f[R] interface returns a
\f[CR]CSSFontFaceDescriptors\f[R] object representing the descriptors
available in the \f[CR]\(atfont\-face\f[R] rule\(cqs body.
.SH VALUE
A \f[CR]CSSFontFaceDescriptors\f[R] object.
.PP
Although the \f[CR]style\f[R] property itself is read\-only in the sense
that you can\(cqt replace the \f[CR]CSSFontFaceDescriptors\f[R] object,
you can still assign to the \f[CR]style\f[R] property directly, which is
equivalent to assigning to its \f[CR]cssText\f[R] property.
You can also modify the \f[CR]CSSFontFaceDescriptors\f[R] object using
the \f[CR]setProperty()\f[R] and \f[CR]removeProperty()\f[R] methods.
.SH EXAMPLES
.SS Basic usage
This example defines a \f[CR]\(atfont\-face\f[R] rule and then uses
\f[CR]CSSFontFaceDescriptors\f[R] to read back the descriptor values.
.SS CSS
.IP
.EX
\f[B]\(atfont\-face\f[R] {
  \f[B]font\-family\f[R]: \(dqMyHelvetica\(dq;
  \f[B]src\f[R]:
    local(\(dqHelvetica Neue Bold\(dq),
    local(\(dqHelveticaNeue\-Bold\(dq),
    url(\(dqMgOpenModernaBold.woff2\(dq) format(\(dqwoff2\(dq);
  \f[B]font\-weight\f[R]: bold;
  \f[B]font\-style\f[R]: normal;
  \f[B]font\-display\f[R]: swap;
}
.EE
.SS JavaScript
.IP
.EX
\f[B]const\f[R] myRules = document.getElementById(\(dqcss\-output\(dq).sheet.cssRules;
\f[B]for\f[R] (\f[B]const\f[R] rule \f[B]of\f[R] myRules) {
  \f[B]if\f[R] (rule \f[B]instanceof\f[R] CSSFontFaceRule) {
    \f[B]const\f[R] descriptors = rule.style;
    \f[B]if\f[R] (descriptors \f[B]instanceof\f[R] CSSStyleDeclaration) {
      log(\(garule.style is a CSSStyleDeclaration.\(ga);
    } \f[B]else\f[R] {
      log(\(garule.style is a CSSFontFaceDescriptors.\(ga);
    }
    log(\(dqDescriptors:\(dq);
    log(\(ga font\-family: ${descriptors.fontFamily}\(ga);
    log(\(ga src: ${descriptors.src}\(ga);
    log(\(ga font\-weight: ${descriptors[\(dqfont\-weight\(dq]}\(ga);
    log(\(ga font\-style: ${descriptors.fontStyle}\(ga);
    log(\(ga font\-display: ${descriptors[\(dqfont\-display\(dq]}\(ga);
  }
}
.EE
